<!-- ID: recommendations -->
## Recommendations

- Repair `_count_classification` so non-zero count mismatches are not reported as `consistent`.
- Add tests for non-zero mismatch cases such as 2 vs 1 and 5 vs 3.
- Re-run the required P6 test and compile commands.
- Preserve the read-only contract. Do not add ingestion, repair, or mutation behavior while fixing classification.
- Keep CHECKLIST `p2-db-reconciliation` not done until repaired P6 receives package-specific Crucible PASS.

